OL,3,GNEWSAAid worker describes 'shocking'
OL,4,Aquake destruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn experienced Merseyside aid worker
OL,7,Fhelping co-ordinate emergency relief in
OL,8,Fthe aftermath of two deadly earthquakes
OL,9,Fin Venezuela this summer has said she
OL,10,Fhad never witnessed anything like it.
OL,12,FAnna Fraine, from Hoylake in Wirral, is
OL,13,Fin South America through her work as a
OL,14,Fprogramme manager for the Disasters
OL,15,FEmergency Committee (DEC).
OL,17,FA DEC spokesperson said 6,500 people
OL,18,Fhad died following the disaster on 24
OL,19,FJune, with more than 86,000 left
OL,20,Frequiring hospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
