OL,3,GNEWSAAid worker describes 'shocking'
OL,4,Aquake destruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking from the capital city Caracas,
OL,7,FFraine told BBC Radio Merseyside that
OL,8,Fshe regularly travelled to areas
OL,9,Faffected by humanitarian crises to work
OL,10,Fwith local response teams but "had not
OL,11,Fseen this level of destruction before".
